description	"Tusken Raider

Sand people with a unique blend of melee, slug-based guns, pet spawning and Wookiee characteristics.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Gaffi Stick (Staff/Yellow Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Lightweight
-- Cripples & poisons on hit
> Tusken Gaffi Stick
-- 14% more AS
-- 20% more knockback
> Chieftain's Gaffi Stick
-- 30% longer
-- 25% more knockback
-- 7% less AS
- Dual Projectile Pistols (Clone Pistol 3)
-- 5% more DMG
-- 20% slower RoF
-- 130% slower reload
-- 30% more FP drain
-- 60% more velocity
-- Mag reload
-- Primary fire only

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Fury (2)
-- 99% slower decay
- Getup (2)
- Strength (1)
- Healing (1)"